;Description
:This template is used to link to a YouTube video.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{yt|<ytvideoid>}}</nowiki></code> nearby the title, and substitute <ytvideoid> with the latter part of the YouTube link (e.g. if the link is https://youtube.com/watch?v=m-ratVcEcGc, the ytvideoid will be "m-ratVcEcGc"). If third argument's value is 'link', it will take link form like the example below. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.
===Example===
#default<br/><pre>{{yt|ytvideoid}}</pre><br/>Output: {{yt|m-ratVcEcGc}}<br /><br /><br />
#link<br /><pre>{{yt|ytvideoid|caption|link}}</pre><br /><pre>{{yt|m-ratVcEcGc|RondeauX of RagnaroQ|link}}</pre><br />Output: {{yt|m-ratVcEcGc|RondeauX of RagnaroQ|link}}<br /><br /><br />
#default, forcedisabled<br/><pre>{{yt|ytvideoid|forcedisabled=true}}</pre><br/>Output: {{yt|m-ratVcEcGc|forcedisabled=true}}<br /><br /><br />
#link, forcedisabled<br /><pre>{{yt|ytvideoid|caption|link|forcedisabled=true}}</pre><br /><pre>{{yt|m-ratVcEcGc|RondeauX of RagnaroQ|link|forcedisabled=true}}</pre><br />Output: {{yt|m-ratVcEcGc|RondeauX of RagnaroQ|link|forcedisabled=true}}

